      "body": "<!-- greptile_summary -->\n\n<h2><a href=\"https://app.greptile.com/api/retrigger?id=93834429\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/RetriggerDark.svg?v=2\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/Retrigger.svg?v=2\"><img alt=\"Retrigger\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/Retrigger.svg?v=2\" align=\"right\"></picture></a><a href=\"https://app.greptile.com/-/switch-tenant?tenant=nvidia-public-github&amp;next=%2FNVIDIA%2Ftransformerengine%2Fpull%2F3794&amp;utm_source=greptile_review&amp;utm_medium=github&amp;utm_campaign=view_in_greptile\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/ViewInGreptileDark.svg?v=2\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/ViewInGreptile.svg?v=2\"><img alt=\"View in Greptile\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/ViewInGreptile.svg?v=2\" align=\"right\"></picture></a>Confidence Score: 5/5</h2>\n\n**[Medium impact]** The PR appears safe to merge; no actionable issues were found.\n\n<h3>Summary</h3>\n\nRaises the minimum supported FlashAttention 4 release to b26.\n- The attention backend skips FlashAttention 4 releases older than 4.0.0b26.\n\nNo actionable issues were found. Tests were not run.\n\n<!-- greptile_confidence_score:5 -->\n\n<sub>Reviews (1) · Last reviewed commit: [\"Merge branch &#39;main&#39; into quack\\_version\\_f...\"](https://github.com/nvidia/transformerengine/commit/19fe9c7353cb080e39763b5dd7fca35c54c9d13c) · [Reviewed by Greptile](https://www.greptile.com/?utm_source=greptile_review&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=review_public&utm_content=nvidia/transformerengine)</sub>",
